    "Transport information, including pickup and destination details, route and trip records, driver, company, fleet and vehicle information, licences or verification documents, safety reports, and support cases.": "Transport information, including pickup and destination details, route and trip records, driver, company, fleet and vehicle information, licences or verification documents, safety reports, and support cases.",
