    "Unauthorized access, scraping private data, malware, denial-of-service activity, reverse engineering protected systems, bypassing rate limits, or interfering with security controls.": "Unauthorized access, scraping private data, malware, denial-of-service activity, reverse engineering protected systems, bypassing rate limits, or interfering with security controls.",
    "UrMall": "UrMall",
    "UrMall Marketplace": "UrMall Marketplace",
    "UrMall Marketplace Policy": "UrMall Marketplace Policy",
    "UrMall helps buyers and sellers discover, communicate, list, order, and request support. Unless separately confirmed, KunThai is not the direct seller of third-party goods or services.": "UrMall helps buyers and sellers discover, communicate, list, order, and request support. Unless separately confirmed, KunThai is not the direct seller of third-party goods or services.",
    "UrMall provides tools for users and independent businesses to discover products and services, communicate, create listings, manage orders or bookings, review experiences, and resolve issues. Unless KunThai expressly identifies itself as the seller, the transaction is between the buyer and the independent seller or service provider.": "UrMall provides tools for users and independent businesses to discover products and services, communicate, create listings, manage orders or bookings, review experiences, and resolve issues. Unless KunThai expressly identifies itself as the seller, the transaction is between the buyer and the independent seller or service provider.",
    "UrRide": "UrRide",
    "Usage information such as pages and features used, searches, interactions, follows, saves, recommendations, notification activity, timestamps, referral information, and approximate session history.": "Usage information such as pages and features used, searches, interactions, follows, saves, recommendations, notification activity, timestamps, referral information, and approximate session history.",
    "Use Area View to find nearby hospitals, police stations, pharmacies, fire services, or safe landmarks.": "Use Area View to find nearby hospitals, police stations, pharmacies, fire services, or safe landmarks.",
