    "Verification badges and reviews are trust signals, not guarantees of identity, legality, quality, availability, safety, or future conduct.": "Verification badges and reviews are trust signals, not guarantees of identity, legality, quality, availability, safety, or future conduct.",
    "Verification can be limited, delayed, or unavailable in some areas.": "Verification can be limited, delayed, or unavailable in some areas.",
