    "Verification records are retained only as needed for trust, safety, fraud prevention, support, legal obligations, or account administration.": "Verification records are retained only as needed for trust, safety, fraud prevention, support, legal obligations, or account administration.",
    "Verified deletion requests are normally processed {legal.deletionProcessingTimeframe}. Eligible account information is deleted or anonymized, while limited records may remain for legal obligations, fraud prevention, safety, disputes, transaction integrity, backups, and the rights of other users.": "Verified deletion requests are normally processed {legal.deletionProcessingTimeframe}. Eligible account information is deleted or anonymized, while limited records may remain for legal obligations, fraud prevention, safety, disputes, transaction integrity, backups, and the rights of other users.",
    "Version history for the Policy Center and future policy changes.": "Version history for the Policy Center and future policy changes.",
    "Violations may lead to rate limits, blocked requests, feature restrictions, account suspension, legal review, or reports to appropriate authorities where required.": "Violations may lead to rate limits, blocked requests, feature restrictions, account suspension, legal review, or reports to appropriate authorities where required.",
    "Violence, threats, harassment, discrimination, property damage, illegal activity, unsafe weapons, and misuse of operator privacy.": "Violence, threats, harassment, discrimination, property damage, illegal activity, unsafe weapons, and misuse of operator privacy.",
    "Warnings, content removal, reduced distribution, feature limits, seller pauses, transport fleet pauses, verification holds, temporary suspension, permanent termination, or device/account-level restrictions where lawful.": "Warnings, content removal, reduced distribution, feature limits, seller pauses, transport fleet pauses, verification holds, temporary suspension, permanent termination, or device/account-level restrictions where lawful.",
    "We keep personal information only for as long as reasonably needed for the purposes described in this policy. The exact period depends on the type of information, the service, user expectations, safety risks, contractual obligations, limitation periods, and legal requirements.": "We keep personal information only for as long as reasonably needed for the purposes described in this policy. The exact period depends on the type of information, the service, user expectations, safety risks, contractual obligations, limitation periods, and legal requirements.",
    "We may label, reduce, restrict, remove, preserve, or report content; limit features; pause transactions; require verification; suspend accounts; or terminate access when reasonably necessary for safety, policy enforcement, legal compliance, fraud prevention, or service integrity.": "We may label, reduce, restrict, remove, preserve, or report content; limit features; pause transactions; require verification; suspend accounts; or terminate access when reasonably necessary for safety, policy enforcement, legal compliance, fraud prevention, or service integrity.",
    "We may limit a feature by country, region, account type, age, verification status, or legal requirement.": "We may limit a feature by country, region, account type, age, verification status, or legal requirement.",
    "We may receive information from other users, businesses, transport operators, public sources, identity or sign-in providers, payment partners, mapping providers, moderation services, and authorities where lawful.": "We may receive information from other users, businesses, transport operators, public sources, identity or sign-in providers, payment partners, mapping providers, moderation services, and authorities where lawful.",
    "We may request verification or temporarily restrict access to protect an account or investigate suspicious activity.": "We may request verification or temporarily restrict access to protect an account or investigate suspicious activity.",
    "We may update these Terms when services, technology, risks, or laws change. The version and update date appear at the top. For material changes, we may provide additional notice in the app, by email, or through another appropriate channel before the changes take effect where required.": "We may update these Terms when services, technology, risks, or laws change. The version and update date appear at the top. For material changes, we may provide additional notice in the app, by email, or through another appropriate channel before the changes take effect where required.",
    "We may update this policy when our services, technology, vendors, risks, or legal duties change. The current version, effective date, and last-updated date appear at the top. We may provide additional notice of material changes through KunThai, email, or another appropriate channel.": "We may update this policy when our services, technology, vendors, risks, or legal duties change. The current version, effective date, and last-updated date appear at the top. We may provide additional notice of material changes through KunThai, email, or another appropriate channel.",
    "We use administrative, technical, and organizational measures designed to protect personal information, including access controls, authentication, database permissions, encrypted network transport, monitoring, backups, moderation controls, and incident-response practices appropriate to the service.": "We use administrative, technical, and organizational measures designed to protect personal information, including access controls, authentication, database permissions, encrypted network transport, monitoring, backups, moderation controls, and incident-response practices appropriate to the service.",
    "We use personal information only for described purposes, compatible purposes, or other purposes disclosed with an appropriate legal basis.": "We use personal information only for described purposes, compatible purposes, or other purposes disclosed with an appropriate legal basis.",
