    "With your permission, KunThai may access location, camera, microphone, photos, files, contacts, and notification capabilities for the feature you request.": "With your permission, KunThai may access location, camera, microphone, photos, files, contacts, and notification capabilities for the feature you request.",
    "You are generally responsible for activity performed through your account unless it results from a security failure outside your reasonable control. Tell support promptly if you suspect unauthorized access, fraud, identity misuse, or loss of a device connected to KunThai.": "You are generally responsible for activity performed through your account unless it results from a security failure outside your reasonable control. Tell support promptly if you suspect unauthorized access, fraud, identity misuse, or loss of a device connected to KunThai.",
    "You are responsible for following the laws that apply to your activity, including rules for online content, consumer protection, trade, taxes, licences, transport, employment, privacy, advertising, exports, sanctions, and restricted products.": "You are responsible for following the laws that apply to your activity, including rules for online content, consumer protection, trade, taxes, licences, transport, employment, privacy, advertising, exports, sanctions, and restricted products.",
    "You are responsible for maintaining a compatible device, internet connection, current app version, and any carrier or data plan needed to use the service.": "You are responsible for maintaining a compatible device, internet connection, current app version, and any carrier or data plan needed to use the service.",
    "You can also open Your Voice, choose Safety, and send a private report with text and, when useful, an optional screenshot or voice note.": "You can also open Your Voice, choose Safety, and send a private report with text and, when useful, an optional screenshot or voice note.",
    "You can withdraw device permissions in system settings, although the related feature may stop working.": "You can withdraw device permissions in system settings, although the related feature may stop working.",
    "You keep ownership of content you create and upload, such as posts, comments, images, videos, voice notes, listings, reviews, messages, and business profile details.": "You keep ownership of content you create and upload, such as posts, comments, images, videos, voice notes, listings, reviews, messages, and business profile details.",
    "You keep ownership of content you create. You give KunThai the licence needed to host, display, process, moderate, recommend, and operate the content within the service.": "You keep ownership of content you create. You give KunThai the licence needed to host, display, process, moderate, recommend, and operate the content within the service.",
    "You may also have the right to contact the privacy, data-protection, or consumer authority where you live. Contacting an authority does not prevent you from asking KunThai to address the concern first.": "You may also have the right to contact the privacy, data-protection, or consumer authority where you live. Contacting an authority does not prevent you from asking KunThai to address the concern first.",
    "You may delete your account through available in-app account controls. You can review the deletion instructions and retention details at {legal.deletionRequestUrl}. We may verify your identity before processing a request to protect the account from unauthorized deletion.": "You may delete your account through available in-app account controls. You can review the deletion instructions and retention details at {legal.deletionRequestUrl}. We may verify your identity before processing a request to protect the account from unauthorized deletion.",
    "You may stop using KunThai at any time and may use available account controls to deactivate or request deletion. We may suspend or terminate access for serious or repeated violations, fraud, danger, legal requirements, prolonged inactivity, or risks to KunThai and its users.": "You may stop using KunThai at any time and may use available account controls to deactivate or request deletion. We may suspend or terminate access for serious or repeated violations, fraud, danger, legal requirements, prolonged inactivity, or risks to KunThai and its users.",
    "You must be at least {legal.minimumAge} years old and meet any higher minimum age required in your country. People below the age of legal majority may use KunThai only with any consent or supervision required by local law.": "You must be at least {legal.minimumAge} years old and meet any higher minimum age required in your country. People below the age of legal majority may use KunThai only with any consent or supervision required by local law.",
